<li>Split documents into pages and process pages in parallel.</li>
<li>Cache results for duplicate documents.</li>
<li>Use autoscaling GPU workers for layout models.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Multi-tenancy</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Isolate document queues and storage per tenant.</li>
<li>Encrypt documents at rest and in transit.</li>
<li>Apply role-based access control to processed output.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Observability</strong></p>
