<li>Track per-page latency, error rate, and OCR confidence.</li>
<li>Log chunk quality metrics such as average chunk size and table coverage.</li>
<li>Monitor retrieval quality with answer correctness and citation precision dashboards.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Billing</strong></p>
